Subject: [PATCH 5/8] apple: add lossless/Atmos format selection policy and
 uploaded library MP4 streaming

Add ProviderConfig (DisableCBCSKeyPrewarm), strict format selection without silent lossless downgrade on transport errors, and streaming support for iCloud uploaded library tracks.

